aphy page (population tables and footnotes)","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/folder/12781"}],"quotes":[{"text":"Российская Федеpация* | 146150789 | -30861 | -599454 | 568593 | 0 | 146119928 | 146135359","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/OkPopul_Comp2025_Site.xlsx"},{"text":"Республика Крым | 1909499 | -7250 | -11410 | 4160 | 0 | 1902249 | 1905874","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/OkPopul_Comp2025_Site.xlsx"},{"text":"г. Севастополь | 561374 | -3072 | -2490 | -582 | 0 | 558302 | 559838","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/OkPopul_Comp2025_Site.xlsx"},{"text":"*Без учета статистической информации по Донецкой Народной Республике (ДНР), Луганской Народной Республике (ЛНР), Запорожской и Херсонской областям.","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/OkPopul_Comp2025_Site.xlsx"}],"accessed":"2026-10-29"},{"key":"net","kind":"researched","text":"Rosstat recorded a net gain of 568,593 people from migration in 2024. The UN shows a net loss of 178,042 people for 2024. Births minus deaths agree closely (Rosstat −599,454, UN −592,272), so the two differ mainly on migration.","figure":{"value":568593,"what":"net migration into Russia in 2024, Rosstat (includes Crimea and Sevastopol, which together recorded +3,578)","date":"2024"},"unFigure":{"value":-178042,"what":"UN net migration figure for Russia in 2024","date":""},"gapPct":-131.3,"verdict":"un-lower","links":[{"label":"Rosstat, Estimate of the resident population on 1 January 2025 and average for 2024, and its components (spreadsheet), 14 Mar 2025","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/OkPopul_Comp2025_Site.xlsx"}],"quotes":[{"text":"Российская Федеpация* | 146150789 | -30861 | -599454 | 568593 | 0 | 146119928 | 146135359 (columns: population on 1 January 2024 | total change | natural increase | migration increase | ... | population on 1 January 2025 | average for 2024)","href":"https://rosstat.gov.ru/storage/mediabank/OkPopul_Comp2025_Site.xlsx"}],"accessed":"20